__pycache__/
build/
dist/
*.spec
output/
input/

# The knowledge graph is derived, not shared -- rebuild it, do not carry it.
# Two things make tracking it actively harmful: a post-commit hook writes its
# output after the commit it follows, so the tree goes dirty the instant any
# commit finishes and those files then block the next checkout or merge; and
# manifest.json records an mtime per file, which a checkout rewrites without
# changing a byte. A cold rebuild takes seconds and costs no API call.
# docs/graphify.md has the rest.
graphify-out/
